# Browsing the catalog: the filters, turning its pages, an installed app's
# page, a built-in app's page, the refresh that fails without Wi-Fi, and the
# installs that fail for want of room or permission. The title is not
# what the route waits on: at the largest size the bar cuts it short.
wait-for Link a browser
wait-for 1 /
expect All
expect Installed
expect Updates
expect Available
expect-missing refreshing
# The list turns forward and back, and its heading says where it is.
tap-id next
wait-for 2 /
shot store-catalog-page-two
expect Previous
tap-id previous
wait-for 1 /
# An installed app's row opens the app; the mark at its edge opens its page,
# which says what it may do in words and offers Open and Uninstall only.
# At the largest size the facts turn onto a second page of their own.
tap-id app-audiobook
wait-for Permissions
expect Can play sound
expect Open
expect Uninstall
expect-missing bluetooth-audio
shot store-detail-installed
maybe-tap-id detail-next
wait-for Managed by App Store
expect-missing Not installed
maybe-tap-id detail-previous
wait-for Permissions
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for 1 /
# The Installed tab lists built-in apps too; Updates has none to offer here.
tap-id filter-installed
wait-for Installed
expect-missing Available to install
tap-id filter-updates
wait-for Every installed app is up to date.
shot store-updates-empty
tap-id filter-all
wait-for 1 /
# Built-in apps come last. Their page offers Open and nothing that would
# remove them. The catalog has no page turn to page by, so the route presses
# More until it is gone: 11 pages at the default size, 26 at the largest.
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
maybe-tap-id next
wait-for Built in
expect Terminal
expect-missing More
shot store-catalog-last-page
tap-id app-terminal
wait-for Built into Cobalt
expect Open
expect-missing Uninstall
shot store-detail-built-in
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Built in
# A refresh with no Wi-Fi keeps the list and says how to fix it; a refresh
# that works takes the banner away.
scenario offline
tap-id refresh
wait-for The list could not be updated
expect Connect to Wi-Fi and refresh.
expect Apps
shot store-refresh-offline
scenario normal
tap-id refresh
wait-idle
expect-missing The list could not be updated
# A reader that is full keeps the app off and says what to check, with Try
# again on the app's page.
tap-id filter-available
wait-for Sudoku
tap Sudoku
wait-for Not installed
scenario storage-full
tap-id install-sudoku
wait-for Couldn't save the change.
expect Try again
expect Not installed
shot store-install-no-room
# A runtime that does not allow app changes says so in words.
scenario permission-denied
tap Try again
wait-for App management isn't available.
expect Not installed
shot store-install-not-allowed
scenario normal
tap-id install-sudoku
wait-for Sudoku is installed.
# Back from a page clears its banner.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Every app in the catalog is installed.
expect-missing Sudoku is installed.
# Link a browser opens its own screen and comes back to the list. The
# simulator has no browser link, so the screen says that in the link's own
# words rather than about installing, and offers no button that cannot work.
tap-id filter-all
tap Link a browser
wait-for Browser links are unavailable
expect This version of Cobalt cannot link a browser on this reader.
expect-missing install apps
expect-missing Reset link
shot store-link-browser
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Link a browser
expect All
